Sleep 500ms
Type "p99 setup"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Wait /Your name, as P99 shows it: $/
Sleep 900ms
Type@40ms "Ada Lovelace"
Enter
Wait /first manager\): $/
Type@35ms "ada@example.com"
Enter
Wait /Paste the token \(hidden\): $/
Sleep 2.5s
Type@8ms "cfut_7Qm2vXk9LpR4sT8wYb3nHd6JfZa1Ce5Gu0Wi"
Enter
Wait /Which account\? \(1-2\): $/
Sleep 1.2s
Type "1"
Enter
Wait /Turn mail on through Resend\? \[y\/N\]: $/
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Wait /comma separated: $/
Sleep 1.5s
Type@35ms "example.com, dev.example.com"
Enter
Wait /Environment of example.com \[production\]: $/
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Wait /\[release\]: $/
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Wait /Environment of dev.example.com \[production\]: $/
Sleep 400ms
Type@60ms "dev"
Enter
Wait /\[development\]: $/
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Wait /--email ada@example.com$/
Sleep 5s
